    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Michael Pigott Auctioneer & Valuer is delighted to present for sale this beautiful three bedroom townhouse situated in the popular Castle Heights development in Carrigaline.\r\n\r\nThis house is superbly presented and maintained by its current owners and the property has many features included such as a modern fitted kitchen with granite worktop and integrated appliances, underfloor heating on the ground floor, built-in wardrobes, fully tiled bathroom, porcelain tiled floor to name just a few. Outside, it has a lovely enclosed rear garden with patio area that offers good privacy and a steel garden shed and to the front, has ample parking.\r\n\r\nIt is most conveniently located within walking distance to all amenities and services in Carrigaline and is just short commute to Cork City Centre, Cork Airport and Ringaskiddy. It also has easy access to a regular public bus service close-by to the entrance of the park. \r\n\r\nViewing of this lovely starter home in a very popular residential development in Carrigaline comes highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 5.08m x 1.88m \r\nTiled flooring, power points, hall stand with mirror and shoe rack, pvc front door with side glass panel and under stairs storage.\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room - 5.07m x 4.13m \r\nThis beautiful and bright kitchen is fitted with very modern fitted kitchen units, granite worktop, washing machine, electric induction hob, self cleaning oven, extractor fan,  microwave, patio door to well maintained rear garden with curtain pole and curtains, tiled floor and ample power points.\r\n\r\nGuest Toilet - 1.4m x 1.52m \r\nDownstairs guest toilet with whb, wc and tiled floor.\r\n\r\nLiving Room - 5.0m x 3.12m \r\nThis beautiful livingroom has a bay window with curtain pole and curtains, gas fire with surround fireplace, beautiful wooden flooring and recess lighting.\r\n\r\nLanding - 1.97m x 2.98m \r\nCarpeted landing with HP and good storage and staire stairs to partly floored attic.\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom - 3.61m x 3.03m \r\nThis beautiful main bedroom has timber floor, bay window with curtain pole and curtains and a built-in wardrobe and dresser, radiator and center light.\r\n\r\nEn-Suite - 2.33m x 0.8m \r\nThe en-suite has a tiled floor, pumped shower from gas combi boiler, wc and whb.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.03m x 2.77m \r\nThis double bedroom has wooden flooring, shelving unit and matching wardrobe, center light and radiator, curtains and curtain pole.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 - 1.96m x 3.1m \r\nThe single bedroom has wooden floor, curtain pole and curtains, beautiful large feature window, built in wardrobe, center light, radiator and power points.\r\n\r\nMain Bathroom - 2.12m x 1.69m \r\nThe main family bathroom has recently been fully renovated and has a large corner walk in shower with Mira Elite electric shower, wc, beautiful hand basin on a lovely built in unit, spot lights and beautiful wall and floor tiling.\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Newly renovated main bathroom.\r\nSteel garden shed.\r\nImmaculate throughout.\r\nFully built in kitchen with granite worktops.\r\nCombi gas boiler replaced last year.\r\nElectric Mira Elite shower"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: B\r\n#106625890"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "From Carrigaline, continue through the main street taking a right at The Corner House Bar. Continue out this road for approximately 1 mile until you come to the roundabout taking a left into Castle Heights.  Upon entering the estate, take your first left again and continue along here, turning right. and next left and No.26 The Willows is located on the right handside, indicated by our \"For Sale\" sign. Follow Eircode: P43 PX25"
      }
    ],
